and the developer, so what happens to most

00:00:52.699 --> 00:00:53.699
people?

00:00:53.699 --> 00:00:54.749
We don't get good at it.

00:00:54.749 --> 00:00:56.739
I want you to get very good at these two areas
[finder and developer].

00:00:56.739 --> 00:00:59.100
And you'll see why it's so important to get
good at those two areas.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:02.710
And at the end of the video I'll also answer
the question to you on which one of them is

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:06.510
the most important question, important position
within your company.

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:07.680
